{{!
    @template tool_vae/referents_page

    The page of the referents of the blocs, below its heading: what a referent is, the error of the last sending, then a
    notification when no record is imported, or the table of the records, the heading and the form to name a referent.

    Every text comes from the context, already worded by tool_vae\output\referents_page. The template holds no logic.
    The text is escaped (double braces). Five keys are HTML made by the core or by another template, placed as they are
    (triple braces): errorhtml and nonehtml, notifications of the core ($output->notification()); tablehtml, the table
    drawn by the template tool_vae/table; headinghtml, a heading of the core ($output->heading()); formhtml, the form of the
    core (moodleform::render()), drawn once.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * intro - string, what a referent is
    * errorhtml - false, or HTML: the error of the last sending
    * nonehtml - false, or HTML: the notification drawn when no record is imported
    * tablehtml - false, or HTML: the table of the records and their referents
    * headinghtml - false, or HTML: the heading above the form
    * formhtml - false, or HTML: the form to name a referent

    Example context (json):
    {
        "intro": "For a bloc of an imported record, name the members of the staff who are told first of a declaration on it.",
        "errorhtml": "<div class=\"alert alert-danger\" role=\"alert\">This username names nobody.</div>",
        "nonehtml": false,
        "tablehtml": "<table class=\"generaltable\"><tbody><tr><td>DEMOBLOCS — Demo blocs</td></tr></tbody></table>",
        "headinghtml": "<h3>Name a referent</h3>",
        "formhtml": "<form method=\"post\" action=\"https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/referents.php\"></form>"
    }
}}
<p>{{intro}}</p>
{{#errorhtml}}
{{{errorhtml}}}
{{/errorhtml}}
{{#nonehtml}}
{{{nonehtml}}}
{{/nonehtml}}
{{#tablehtml}}
{{{tablehtml}}}
{{/tablehtml}}
{{#headinghtml}}
{{{headinghtml}}}
{{/headinghtml}}
{{#formhtml}}
{{{formhtml}}}
{{/formhtml}}
